        "# Deadlock\n",
        "\n",
        "A deadlock occurs when operations wait indefinitely for one another to release resources or make progress. For example, two threads can deadlock by acquiring two locks in opposite orders.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-deadlock)"
      ]
    }
  ],
